Description:You are at 3 life and the opponent's Hill Giant is attacking you. You control a 4/4 Bear token enchanted with the opponent's Pacifism and three Plains, and have Acrobatic Maneuver and Holy Day in hand. Survive the turn.
Rule:rulesguru-bf58c7d51c1eaf63 | A token that leaves the battlefield cannot come back (CR 111.8) and ceases to exist (CR 704.5d): Acrobatic Maneuver on the token exiles it for good, so it cannot shed Pacifism and block; Holy Day is the line that survives
